{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2021-06-25 09:35:00', 'title': 'OMNICOM OUTPERFORMS THE INDUSTRY, WINNING HIGH HONORS IN BOTH MEDIA AND CREATIVITY', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JUNE 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AT CANNES LIONS LIVE 2021, OMNICOM GROUP (NYSE: OMC) AGENCIES WERE RECOGNIZED FOR THEIR EXCELLENCE WITHIN BOTH THE CREATIVE AND MEDIA DISCIPLINES. ALL THREE OMNICOM CREATIVE NETWORKS (BBDO, DDB AND TBWA) PLACED IN THE TOP TEN OF THE NETWORK OF THE FESTIVAL\xa0COMPETITION, WITH BBDO COMING IN THIRD, DDB IN SIXTH AND TBWA IN SEVENTH.'}{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2021-06-25 09:30:00', 'title': 'AMVBBDO LONDON NAMED AGENCY OF THE FESTIVAL AT 2021 CANNES LIONS INTERNATIONAL FESTIVAL OF CREATIVITY', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JUNE 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AT THE 2021 CANNES LIONS INTERNATIONAL FESTIVAL OF CREATIVITY, LONDON AGENCY AMVBBDO WAS NAMED GLOBAL AGENCY OF THE FESTIVAL.\xa0THE AGENCY WON A REMARKABLE 5 GRAND PRIX, 5 GOLD LIONS, 9 SILVER LIONS AND 8 BRONZE LIONS, INCLUDING THE FESTIVAL\'S TOP LION, THE TITANIUM GRAND PRIX FOR ITS "#WOMBSTORIES" CAMPAIGN FOR BODYFORM/LIBRESSE.'}